# Design

Follow `capstone-broadcast-design` for palette/mark and `capstone-signal-design` for harness.

- Canvas `#F7F8FC`, primary rose `#E11D48`, Syne + Figtree
- Brand mark = crop frame + live corner (not Checkpoint teal)
- Lenis on landing, Framer Motion `once: true`, full hover/focus
- Custom scrollbars with rose hover thumb
- No em dashes
